show you. Honestly, it's very subtle, and three&nbsp;
gold stars for anyone who can identify it. 
&nbsp;

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:19.520
The first thing I'll do is draw the&nbsp;
perpendicular bisector for the line BC.&nbsp;&nbsp;

