So that means this angle here is 90 degrees, and&nbsp;
this length is by definition the same as this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:31.600
length. And we'll label that intersection point D.&nbsp;
And then next I will draw the angle bisector at A,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:36.640
which means by definition this little angle here&nbsp;
is the same as this little angle here. I'll label&nbsp;&nbsp;

