&nbsp;

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:12.880
My first claim is that this triangle here, which&nbsp;
is AFP, is the same, or at least congruent, to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:19.520
this triangle over here, AEP. Essentially this&nbsp;
follows from symmetry across that angle bisector.&nbsp;&nbsp;

